{"video":"7KGyshSMa04","lines":[{"t":[0,1],"en":"Hey."},{"t":[1,2],"en":"Hey."},{"t":[2,4],"en":"So, uh, did everything go okay with the annulment?"},{"t":[4,5],"en":"Oh, yeah."},{"t":[5,6],"en":"No problems."},{"t":[6,7],"en":"It's all taken care of."},{"t":[7,8],"en":"Ross, thank you."},{"t":[8,9],"en":"Oh."},{"t":[9,10],"en":"Oh."},{"t":[10,11],"en":"Hey, do you guys wanna go see a movie?"},{"t":[11,12],"en":"Oh, yeah."},{"t":[12,13],"en":"Why not?"},{"t":[13,14],"en":"I'm gonna get my sweater."},{"t":[14,15],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[17,19],"en":"You wanna hear something weird?"},{"t":[19,20],"en":"Always."},{"t":[22,24],"en":"I didn't get the annulment."},{"t":[26,27],"en":"What?"},{"t":[27,29],"en":"We're still married."},{"t":[29,31],"en":"Don't tell Rachel."},{"t":[31,32],"en":"See you later."},{"t":[35,36],"en":"Hey, do you have any gum?"},{"t":[36,37],"en":"Oh."},{"t":[39,40],"en":"Wait."},{"t":[40,41],"en":"Wait."},{"t":[41,42],"en":"Hi."},{"t":[42,43],"en":"Listen, Ross, can I just talk to you for just a second?"},{"t":[43,45],"en":"Oh, but Phoebe, we're gonna be late for the movie."},{"t":[45,46],"en":"Oh, there's a cab."},{"t":[46,47],"en":"Taxi!"},{"t":[48,49],"en":"Oh, that's funny."},{"t":[49,51],"en":"What timing, my God, huh?"},{"t":[51,52],"en":"There you go."},{"t":[52,53],"en":"There you go."},{"t":[53,55],"en":"We're actually just gonna walk 'cause it's right up there at the Angelica."},{"t":[55,56],"en":"Oh, the Angelica!"},{"t":[56,57],"en":"Go!"},{"t":[57,58],"en":"Yeah!"},{"t":[60,61],"en":"You didn't get the annulment?"},{"t":[61,62],"en":"I know."},{"t":[63,64],"en":"Ross?"},{"t":[64,69],"en":"Well, I tried, but when I got to my lawyer's office, all I could hear was, \"Three divorces!"},{"t":[69,70],"en":"Three divorces!\""},{"t":[70,75],"en":"Look, I just don't want my tombstone to read Ross Geller, \"Three divorces.\""},{"t":[76,78],"en":"Don't be worried about that!"},{"t":[78,80],"en":"Your tombstone could say whatever you want it to say."